2. PRESERVE all behavior - this is pure structural change
3. Match existing code style in related files
4. Improve internal organization, naming, structure
5. Do NOT add features or change logic

Allowed changes:
- Rename internal (non-exported) variables/functions
- Reorganize code within the file
- Extract helper functions (keep private)
- Improve internal comments
- Better organize imports

NOT allowed:
- Change any export signatures
- Change behavior or logic
- Add new features
- Fix bugs (unless that's the refactor goal)
- Change the public interface

